WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Johannesburg, sheba lerako lona leo la dimithara tse pedi motsheare.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Bohareng ba hlabula letsatsi le fihla ho 87°. Lerako le etsa moriti o mokgutshwane.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Ha mariha a atamela, letsatsi le ba tlase motsheare. Moriti o lelefala ho ya borwa.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:29.000
Bohareng ba mariha letsatsi le fihla ho 40°. Moriti o ka ba 2.4 m ka bolelele.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Mona mariha moriti o ka ho le letona, ka borwa. Bethe e ka ho le letshehadi, ka leboya, e fumana letsatsi.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Lema dimela tse kgutshwane ka lehlakoreng la leboya la lerako le lelelele.
